\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. All people that on earth do dwell,
\par Sing to the Lord with cheerful Voice
\par Him serve with mirth, His praise forth tell;
\par Come ye before Him and rejoice.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The Lord, ye know, is God indeed:
\par Without our aid He did us make:
\par We are His folk, He doth us feed;
\par And for His sheep He doth us take.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O enter then His gates with praise;
\par Approach with joy His courts unto;
\par Praise, laud, and bless His name always,
\par For it is seemly so to do.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. For why? The Lord our God is good;
\par His mercy is for ever sure;
\par His truth at all times firmly stood,
\par And shall from age to age endure.
\par Amen!.
\par \cf1\ul\b\f1\fs16 
\par 
\par }

